/** @page treesitterpackagingguide Packaging and query resources

    @tableofcontents

    Debian/Ubuntu packages include all parsers, upstream queries, compiler metadata,
    API documentation and debug symbols. They use a shared system tree-sitter runtime
    and pinned offline grammar sources. The Qore grammar comes from the matching SDK.
    SQL uses the committed generated parser without modifying downloaded sources.

    Set \c QORE_TREESITTER_QUERY_DIR to select an alternate query root containing language
    subdirectories. Cached queries are keyed by canonical filename and respect the current
    caller's filesystem sandbox. Query-loading methods require filesystem access.
*/
